  },
  {
    "speaker": "夢追いガール",
    "text": "あっ、ありがとうございます！\r\nお恥ずかしいところ、お見せしまして",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004004020020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そがんことなかよ！\r\n一生懸命で……胸のぎゅ～ってなったと",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400402/1004004020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組ディレクター",
    "text": "ガールのこの後の予定は？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "夢追いガール",
    "text": "えっと、14時からモダンバレエ、\r\n18時から飲食店のバイトですね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004004020030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "え～！　レッスンの後に？\r\nバイトって立ち仕事やろ？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400402/1004004020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "夢追いガール",
    "text": "そうなんです。でも、お店のまかないで\r\n唐揚げが食べられるんで……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004004020040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～！\r\nそいはよか～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400402/1004004020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004004020050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ばってん、オーディション前に\r\nバテてしまわんか心配やね～",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400402/1004004020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "夢追いガール",
    "text": "そうですね、レッスンもたくさん入れてしまって……\r\nでも、バイト減らしたら生活費なくなっちゃうし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "夢追いガール",
    "text": "実は、親に反対されてて\r\n学校やめてから仕送りももらってないんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004004020060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そうやったと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400402/1004004020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "夢追いガール",
    "text": "絶対オーディションに受かりたいです\r\n劇団に所属して……早く舞台に立ちたいです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004004020070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん……！　絶対大丈夫ばい！\r\nうちも、応援しとるけん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
