    "voice": "produce_events/100400402/1004004020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004004020180,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "それなら、仕方なか！\r\nうちはどの仕事もできて嬉しかけん",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400402/1004004020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004004020190,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "それに、あの子見とったら、\r\nまだまだ頑張らんば～って思うとよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400402/1004004020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、夢追いガールの子か？\r\n確かに、バイトにレッスンに、よくやってるよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004004020200,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……これまでにも、オーディションいっぱい受けて\r\n落ち続けとるとって",
